Files: src/libImaging/QuantOctree.c, src/libImaging/QuantOctree.h, src/libImaging/QuantTypes.h, and src/libImaging/ImagingUtils.h
The four source files are unmodified and compile as C without the Python runtime.
src/image.cpp adapts the Lanczos and box coefficient calculation, fixed-point resampling, alpha composition, padding, and enhancement behaviour from Pillow's Resample.c, AlphaComposite.c, Blend.c, ImageOps.py, and ImageEnhance.py.
The adapted implementation uses OpenQR's RGBA image and animation model, bounds intermediate image allocations, and retains Pillow's radius-3 Lanczos filter.
